WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,420 --> 00:00:02,460
So shameless

2
00:00:02,780 --> 00:00:04,500
Isn't this clearly bullying the teacher?

3
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:06,300
Twenty-five million things

4
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:07,580
I want to take away 10 million

5
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:09,420
If they don't sell, they'll force people to clean the toilets.

6
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:11,700
These shareholders are so heartless

7
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:17,360
Doesn't your dad care?

8
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:19,560
After all, he was also a partner back then.

9
00:00:21,420 --> 00:00:22,820
My dad reorganized the family

10
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:25,120
Bad investment outside the province

11
00:00:25,870 --> 00:00:30,040
I don't have the ability to take care of things here.

12
00:00:30,360 --> 00:00:31,560
This kind of thing where bullies bully people

13
00:00:31,560 --> 00:00:34,600
We can't ignore things, your dad can't control them, but in front of us

14
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:36,320
Aren’t you a very capable boss?

15
00:00:36,480 --> 00:00:38,360
He can help you coordinate with just one sentence, right?

16
00:00:38,520 --> 00:00:40,120
The boss can easily throw out 60 million

17
00:00:40,280 --> 00:00:41,440
Are we still afraid of a few small shareholders?

18
00:00:41,560 --> 00:00:42,960
The boss can definitely take care of it
